    "summary": "成为稳定盈利交易者的唯一途径是承认自己永远无知",
    "adapter": "generic",
    "metadata": {
      "coverImage": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGpkkb2bMAAuhIt.jpg",
      "language": "zh-cn",
